É MüÉ EmÉrÉÉåaÉ\ne) Shareholders may access the VC at https://emeetings.kfintech.com/under\nMüUMåü https://emeetings.kfintech.com/ Måü qÉÉkrÉqÉ\nShareholders / Members login by using the remote e-Voting credentials. The link for e-AGM will be available in Shareholder / members login where the EVENT and the name of the company can be selected. Please note that the Shareholders who do not have the User ID and Password for e-Voting or have forgotten the User ID and Password may retrieve the same by following the remote e-Voting instructions mentioned in the notice.","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c42","section":"Front matter","tag":"other","page":17,"text":"xÉå xÉSxrÉ sÉÊÌaÉlÉ Måü iÉWûiÉ uÉÏxÉÏ MüÉ EmÉrÉÉåaÉ MüU xÉMüiÉå WæÇû| D-LeÉÏLqÉ Måü ÍsÉL ÍsÉÇMü zÉårÉUkÉÉUMü / xÉSxrÉÉåÇ Måü sÉÊÌaÉlÉ qÉåÇ EmÉsÉokÉ WûÉåaÉÉ eÉWûÉÇ CuÉåÇOû AÉæU MÇümÉlÉÏ Måü lÉÉqÉ MüÉ cÉrÉlÉ ÌMürÉÉ eÉÉ xÉMüiÉÉ Wæû| M×ümÉrÉÉ krÉÉlÉ SåÇ ÌMü ÎeÉlÉ zÉårÉUkÉÉUMüÉåÇ Måü mÉÉxÉ D-uÉÉåÌOÇûaÉ Måü ÍsÉL rÉÔeÉU AÉDQûÏ AÉæU mÉÉxÉuÉQïû lÉWûÏÇ Wæû rÉÉ rÉÔeÉU AÉDQûÏ AÉæU mÉÉxÉuÉQïû pÉÔsÉ aÉL WæÇû, uÉå lÉÉåÌOûxÉ qÉåÇ EÎssÉÎZÉiÉ ËUqÉÉåOû D-uÉÉåÌOÇûaÉ ÌlÉSåïzÉÉåÇ MüÉ mÉÉsÉlÉ MüUMåü CxÉå mÉÑlÉÈ mÉëÉmiÉ MüU xÉMüiÉå WæÇû|\nf) zÉårÉUkÉÉUMüÉåÇ MüÉå oÉåWûiÉU AlÉÑpÉuÉ Måü ÍsÉL aÉÔaÉsÉ ¢üÉåqÉ Måü\nxÉÉjÉ sÉæmÉOûÊmÉ Måü qÉÉkrÉqÉ xÉå oÉæPûMü qÉåÇ zÉÉÍqÉsÉ WûÉålÉå Måü ÍsÉL mÉëÉåixÉÉÌWûiÉ ÌMürÉÉ eÉÉiÉÉ Wæû|\nf) Shareholders are encouraged to join the meeting through laptops with Google Chrome for better experience.\ng) CxÉMåü AsÉÉuÉÉ, zÉårÉUkÉÉUMüÉåÇ MüÉå MæüqÉUÉ MüÐ AlÉÑqÉÌiÉ SålÉå MüÐ\nAÉuÉzrÉMüiÉÉ WûÉåaÉÏ, rÉÌS MüÉåD WûÉå, AÉæU CxÉÍsÉL oÉæPûMü Måü SÉæUÉlÉ ÌMüxÉÏ pÉÏ aÉÄQûoÉÄQûÏ xÉå oÉcÉlÉå Måü ÍsÉL AcNûÏ aÉÌiÉ Måü CÇOûUlÉåOû MüÉ EmÉrÉÉåaÉ MüUåÇ|\ng) Further, Shareholders will be required to allow\ncamera, if any, and hence use internet with a good speed to avoid any disturbance during the meeting.\nh) M×ümÉrÉÉ krÉÉlÉ SåÇ ÌMü qÉÉåoÉÉCsÉ EmÉMüUhÉÉåÇ rÉÉ OæûoÉsÉåOû rÉÉ\nh) Please note that participants connecting from","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c43","section":"Front matter","tag":"other","page":17,"text":"h) Please note that participants connecting from\nqÉÉåoÉÉCsÉ WûÊOûxmÉÊOû Måü qÉÉkrÉqÉ xÉå sÉæmÉOûÊmÉ eÉÉåÄQûMüU eÉÑQûlÉå uÉÉsÉå mÉëÌiÉpÉÉaÉÏ AmÉlÉå xÉÇoÉÇÍkÉiÉ lÉåOûuÉMïü qÉåÇ EiÉÉU-cÉÄRûÉuÉ Måü MüÉUhÉ BÌQûrÉÉå / uÉÏÌQûrÉÉå MüÐ aÉÑhÉuÉ¨ÉÉ qÉåÇ MüqÉÏ MüÉ AlÉÑpÉuÉ MüU xÉMüiÉå WæÇû| CxÉÍsÉL EmÉUÉå£ü ÌMüxÉÏ pÉÏ mÉëMüÉU MüÐ aÉÄQûoÉÄQûÏ xÉå oÉcÉlÉå Måü ÍsÉL ÎxjÉU uÉÉD-TüÉD rÉÉ sÉælÉ MülÉåYzÉlÉ MüÉ EmÉrÉÉåaÉ MüUlÉå MüÐ ÍxÉTüÉËUzÉ MüÐ eÉÉiÉÏ Wæû|\nmobile devices or tablets or through laptop connecting via mobile hotspot may experience audio / video loss due to fluctuation in their respective network. It is therefore recommended to use stable Wi-Fi or LAN connection to mitigate any kind of aforesaid glitches.\ni) ÌMüxÉÏ pÉÏ mÉëMüÉU MüÐ xÉWûÉrÉiÉÉ Måü ÍsÉL ÌWûiÉkÉÉUMü AÉUOûÏL/\ni) The stakeholders may contact RTA / Technical helpdesk at evoting@kfintech.com for any assistance.\niÉMülÉÏMüÐ xÉWûÉrÉiÉÉ MåÇüSì xÉå evoting@kfintech.com mÉU xÉÇmÉMïü MüU xÉMüiÉå WæÇû|\n4. MüÉrÉïxÉÔcÉÏ qÉSÉåÇ mÉU mÉëzlÉ 4. MüÉrÉïxÉÔcÉÏ qÉSÉåÇ mÉU mÉëzlÉ\n4. QUERIES ON AGENDA ITEMS","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c44","section":"Front matter","tag":"other","page":17,"text":"4. QUERIES ON AGENDA ITEMS\nThe Shareholders who would like to express their views / pose queries on agenda items may submit their questions in the speaker registration window provided to them at their login page https://evoting.kfintech.com/, by mentioning their name, folio / demat details, e-mail ID and mobile number. The “AGM Questions” window shall be activated from 10 A.M. IST on 10th Ju