ü qÉåÇ CxÉå mÉÉËUiÉ ÌMürÉÉ aÉrÉÉ jÉÉ, ExÉMåü AkrÉ¤É ²ÉUÉ qÉÔsÉ mÉëÌiÉ Måü xÉÉjÉ DqÉåsÉ ²ÉUÉ sashi.mannava@kfintech.com / hosecretarial@ canarabank.com mÉU, AjÉuÉÉ WûÉQïû MüÊmÉÏ Måü ÃmÉ qÉåÇ' xÉÍcÉuÉÉsÉrÉ ÌuÉpÉÉaÉ, MåülÉUÉ oÉæÇMü mÉëkÉÉlÉ MüÉrÉÉïsÉrÉ, 112 eÉå.xÉÏ. UÉåQû, oÉåÇaÉsÉÔÂ-560002 Måü mÉiÉå mÉU mÉëqÉÉÍhÉiÉ lÉ ÌMürÉÉ aÉrÉÉ WûÉå, oÉæÇMü Måü mÉëkÉÉlÉ MüÉrÉÉïsÉrÉ qÉåÇ uÉÉÌwÉïMü AÉqÉ oÉæPûMü MüÐ iÉÉUÏZÉ xÉå MüqÉ xÉå MüqÉ cÉÉU ÌSlÉ mÉWûsÉå, AjÉÉïiÉ aÉÑÂuÉÉU, 18 eÉÔlÉ, 2026 MüÉå oÉæÇMü Måü","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c51","section":"Front matter","tag":"other","page":18,"text":"No person shall be entitled to participate or vote at the meeting as a duly authorized representative of a company or any other Body Corporate which is a Shareholder of the Bank, unless a copy of the resolution appointing him/ her as a duly authorized representative, certified to be true copy by the Chairman of the meeting at which it was passed, shall have been sent either by e-mail to sashi.mannava@kfintech.com / hosecretarial@canarabank.com or in hard copy addressed to ‘Secretarial Department, Canara Bank Head Office, 112, J C Road, Bengaluru-560002’ not later than four days before the date of the Annual General Meeting i.e., on or before the closing hours of the Bank on Thursday, the 18th June, 2026.\nxÉqÉÉmÉlÉ xÉqÉrÉ mÉU rÉÉ ExÉxÉå mÉWûsÉå eÉqÉÉ ÌMürÉÉ eÉÉlÉÉ WûÉåaÉÉ|\n7. COMMUNICATION WITH THE REGISTRAR AND TRANSFER AGENT (RTA)\n7. UÎeÉxOíûÉU AÉæU OíûÉÇxÉTüU LeÉåÇOû (AÉUOûÏL) Måü xÉÉjÉ xÉÇmÉëåwÉhÉ 7. UÎeÉxOíûÉU AÉæU OíûÉÇxÉTüU LeÉåÇOû (AÉUOûÏL) Måü xÉÉjÉ xÉÇmÉëåwÉhÉ","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c52","section":"Front matter","tag":"other","page":18,"text":"7. UÎeÉxOíûÉU AÉæU OíûÉÇxÉTüU LeÉåÇOû (AÉUOûÏL) Måü xÉÉjÉ xÉÇmÉëåwÉhÉ 7. UÎeÉxOíûÉU 