quested to intimate the aforesaid changes / e-mail IDs only to their depository participants.\nAqÉÔiÉï ÃmÉ qÉåÇ zÉårÉU UZÉlÉå uÉÉsÉå zÉårÉUkÉÉUMüÉåÇ xÉå AlÉÑUÉåkÉ Wæû ÌMü uÉå EmÉUÉå£ü mÉËUuÉiÉïlÉÉåÇ / D-qÉåsÉ AÉDQûÏ MüÉå MåüuÉsÉ AmÉlÉå ÌlÉ¤ÉåmÉÉaÉÉU mÉëÌiÉpÉÉÌaÉrÉÉåÇ MüÉå xÉÔÍcÉiÉ MüUåÇ|\n8. DEMATERIALIZATION OF PHYSICAL HOLDINGS\n8. pÉÉæÌiÉMü zÉårÉUÉåÇ MüÉ ApÉÉæÌiÉMüÐMüUhÉ 8. pÉÉæÌiÉMü zÉårÉUÉåÇ MüÉ ApÉÉæÌiÉMüÐMüUhÉ\nAs per Regulation 40 of SEBI Listing Regulations, as amended, all requests for transfer of securities including transmission and transposition requests shall be processed only in dematerialized form. Hence, we request the Shareholders to kindly Demat their physical holding immediately.","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c54","section":"Front matter","tag":"other","page":19,"text":"As per Regulation 40 of SEBI Listing Regulations, as amended, all requests for transfer of securities including transmission and transposition requests shall be processed only in dematerialized form. Hence, we request the Shareholders to kindly Demat their physical holding immediately.\nxÉåoÉÏ xÉÔÍcÉoÉ® ÌuÉÌlÉrÉqÉÉåÇ Måü ÌuÉÌlÉrÉqÉ 40 (rÉjÉÉxÉÇzÉÉåÍkÉiÉ) Måü AlÉÑxÉÉU, mÉëÌiÉpÉÔÌiÉrÉÉåÇ Måü AÇiÉUhÉ Måü ÍsÉL xÉpÉÏ AlÉÑUÉåkÉ, ÎeÉlÉqÉåÇ mÉëåwÉhÉ AÉæU mÉëÌiÉxjÉÉmÉlÉ AlÉÑUÉåkÉ zÉÉÍqÉsÉ WæÇû, MåüuÉsÉ ApÉÉæÌiÉMü ÃmÉ qÉåÇ WûÏ xÉÇxÉÉÍkÉiÉ ÌMüL eÉÉLÇaÉå| AiÉÈ, WûqÉ zÉårÉUkÉÉUMüÉåÇ xÉå AlÉÑUÉåkÉ MüUiÉå WæÇû ÌMü uÉå M×ümÉrÉÉ AmÉlÉÏ pÉÉæÌiÉMü zÉårÉUÉåÇ MüÉ iÉÑUÇiÉ ApÉÉæÌiÉMüÐMüUhÉ MüUuÉÉ sÉåÇ|\nFor dematerialization, Shareholders may contact their respective Depository Participant, where they maintain their respective demat account. Benefits of dematerialization are as follows: i) Hassle-free transfer ii) No threat of loss of share certificate iii) Direct and prompt credit of Dividend / Corporate benefits iv) Nomination facility v) Direct application through ASBA / IPO, e