. uÉÉÌwÉïMü ËUmÉÉåOïû","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c73","section":"Front matter","tag":"other","page":23,"text":"12. uÉÉÌwÉïMü ËUmÉÉåOïû 12. uÉÉÌwÉïMü ËUmÉÉåOïû\nShareholders of the Bank may please note that in compliance with the various Circulars issued by MCA, GOI and SEBI, the Bank will send the physical copies of Annual Report to the Shareholders who request for the same. The full copy of the Annual Report is uploaded on the website of the Bank (www.canarabank.bank.in). Shareholders may download the readable version of the same from the website. The notice can also be accessed from the websites of BSE Limited, National Stock Exchange of India Limited & e-Voting agency KFin Technologies Limited at www.bseindia.com, www.nseindia.com and https://evoting.kfintech.com respectively.\noÉæÇMü Måü zÉårÉUkÉÉUMü M×ümÉrÉÉ lÉÉåOû MüUåÇ ÌMü LqÉxÉÏL, pÉÉUiÉ xÉUMüÉU\nAÉæU xÉåoÉÏ ²ÉUÉ eÉÉUÏ ÌuÉÍpÉ³É mÉËUmÉ§ÉÉåÇ Måü AlÉÑmÉÉsÉlÉ qÉåÇ, oÉæÇMü\nzÉårÉUkÉÉUMüÉåÇ MüÉå uÉÉÌwÉïMü ËUmÉÉåOïû MüÐ pÉÉæÌiÉMü mÉëÌiÉrÉÉÇ pÉåeÉåaÉÉ,\neÉÉå CxÉMåü ÍsÉL AlÉÑUÉåkÉ MüUåaÉÉ| uÉÉÌwÉïMü ËUmÉÉåOïû MüÐ mÉÔUÏ mÉëÌiÉ\noÉæÇMü MüÐ uÉåoÉxÉÉCOû (www.canarabank.bank.in) mÉU AmÉsÉÉåQû\nMüÐ aÉD Wæû| zÉårÉUkÉÉUMü uÉåoÉxÉÉCOû xÉå CxÉMüÉ mÉPûlÉÏrÉ xÉÇxMüUhÉ\nQûÉElÉsÉÉåQû MüU xÉMüiÉå WæÇû| CxÉ lÉÉåÌOûxÉ MüÉå oÉÏLxÉD ÍsÉÍqÉOåûQû,\nLlÉLxÉD ÍsÉÍqÉOåûQû AÉæU D-uÉÉåÌOÇûaÉ LeÉåÇxÉÏ MåüÌTülÉ OåûYlÉÉåsÉÊeÉÏeÉ\nÍsÉÍqÉOåûQû MüÐ uÉåoÉxÉÉCOû ¢üqÉzÉÈ www.bseindia.com,\nwww.nseindia.com AÉæU https://evoting.kfintech.\ncom mÉU pÉÏ SåZÉÉ eÉÉ xÉMüiÉÉ Wæû|","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c74","section":"Front matter","tag":"other","page":23,"text":"com mÉU pÉÏ SåZÉÉ eÉÉ xÉMüiÉÉ Wæû|\n13. mÉiÉå qÉåÇ mÉËUuÉiÉïlÉ / sÉÉpÉÉÇzÉ AÍkÉSåzÉ: 13. mÉiÉå qÉåÇ mÉËUuÉiÉïlÉ / sÉÉpÉÉÇzÉ AÍkÉSåzÉ:\n13. CHANG