UÉåkÉ MüU xÉMåÇüaÉå AÉæU MüUlÉå xÉå AÉmÉ xÉåuÉÉAÉåÇ Måü ÍsÉL ÌlÉoÉÉïkÉ AlÉÑUÉåkÉ MüU xÉMåÇüaÉå AÉæU AÉmÉMåü oÉæÇMü ZÉÉiÉå qÉåÇ sÉÉpÉÉÇzÉ eÉqÉÉ WûÉå xÉMåüaÉÉ; YrÉÉåÇÌMü ÌSlÉÉÇMü AÉmÉMåü oÉæÇMü ZÉÉiÉå qÉåÇ sÉÉpÉÉÇzÉ eÉqÉÉ WûÉå xÉMåüaÉÉ;","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c128","section":"Front matter","tag":"other","page":35,"text":"YrÉÉåÇÌMü ÌSlÉÉÇMü 01 AmÉëæsÉ, 2024 xÉå, sÉÉpÉÉÇzÉ MüÉ pÉÑaÉiÉÉlÉ pÉÉæÌiÉMü uÉÉUÇOû eÉÉUÏ 01 AmÉëæsÉ, 2024 xÉå, sÉÉpÉÉÇzÉ MüÉ pÉÑaÉiÉÉlÉ pÉÉæÌiÉMü uÉÉUÇOû eÉÉUÏ MüUMåü lÉWûÏÇ ÌMürÉÉ eÉÉLaÉÉ| AÉmÉMüÐ xÉÑÌuÉkÉÉ WåûiÉÑ, AÉmÉ AmÉlÉÏ MüUMåü lÉWûÏÇ ÌMürÉÉ eÉÉLaÉÉ| AÉmÉMüÐ xÉÑÌuÉkÉÉ WåûiÉÑ, AÉmÉ AmÉlÉÏ pÉÉæÌiÉMü zÉårÉU WûÉåÎsQÇûaÉ MüÉå ApÉÉæÌiÉMüÐMüUhÉ pÉÏ MüUuÉÉ xÉMüiÉå WæÇû, pÉÉæÌiÉMü zÉårÉU WûÉåÎsQÇûaÉ MüÉå ApÉÉæÌiÉMüÐMüUhÉ pÉÏ MüUuÉÉ xÉMüiÉå WæÇû, iÉÉÌMü AÉmÉ CsÉåYOíûÊÌlÉMü sÉÉpÉÉÇzÉ pÉÑaÉiÉÉlÉ MüÉ sÉÉpÉ EPûÉ xÉMåÇü| iÉÉÌMü AÉmÉ CsÉåYOíûÊÌlÉMü sÉÉpÉÉÇzÉ pÉÑaÉiÉÉlÉ MüÉ sÉÉpÉ EPûÉ xÉMåÇü|\nIn view of the above, if you are holding shares in physical form, you are required to furnish valid PAN, Contact Details, Bank Account Details and updated Specimen Signature immediately to the Bank’s RTA in the prescribed forms (available on the Bank’s website: https://www.canarabank.bank.in/ under the link: https://www.canarabank.bank.in/ shareholder-information, if not already done, to avail uninterrupted service requests as well as credit of dividend in bank account, as no dividend will be paid by way of issuance of physical warrant, with effect from 1st April, 2024. For your convenience, you may also dematerialise the physical holding so as to avail the benefit of electronic dividend payment.","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c129","section":"Front matter","tag":"other","page":35,"text":"22. ÌlÉuÉåzÉ qÉåÇ xÉÑaÉqÉiÉÉ 22