ess.\ni) समि�ति� केे कार्योंं मेंंं नि�म्नलि�खि�त शाामि�ल हैंं;","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c767","section":"Corporate Governance","tag":"governance","page":296,"text":"i) समि�ति� केे कार्योंं मेंंं नि�म्नलि�खि�त शाामि�ल हैंं;\n2. To ensure that Capital to Risk Weighted Assets Ratio is maintained above the minimum regulatory requirement along with the prescribed norms.\n1. पूंं�जीी नि�योजन प्रक्रि�या की देेखरेेख करनाा।\n2. यह सुुनि�श्चििȋत करनाा कि� पूंं�जीी सेे जोखि\u001aम भारि�त आस्तिȣ अनुुपाात नि�र्धाधाारि�त माानदंंडोंं केे साथ न्यूूनतम विि9नि�यामक आवश्यकताा सेे ऊपर बनााए रखाा जाए।\n3. To recommend quantum, mode and types of Capital raising, as per the requirement.\n3. आवश्यकताानुुसार पूंं�जीी जुुटानेे की माात्रा, तरीीकेे और प्रकार की सि�फाारि�श करनाा।\n4. To ensure compliance of instruction / directions of Ministry / RBI / any other statutory body in the matter relating to Capital.\n4. पूंं�जीी सेे संंबंंधि�त माामलेे मेंं मंंत्रालय / आरबीीआई / कि�सीी अन्य वैैधाानि�क नि�कााय केे अनुुदेेशोंं / नि�र्देेशोंं का अनुुपाालन सुुनि�श्चििȋत करनाा।\n5. To decide on Modalities of Qualified Institutional Placement.\n5. योग्य संंस्थाागत नि�योजन की रूपरेेखा पर नि�र्णणय लेेना।\n6. To carefully consider the qualification, experience, profile and background of the various candidates and take a decision in supporting the candidates in the election as Shareholder Directors in various Companies, including Banks and Financial Institutions where the Bank has equity.","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c768","section":"Corporate Governance","tag":"governance","page":296,"text":"6. To carefully consider the qualification, experience, profile and background of the various candidates and take a decision in supporting the candidates in the election