बाज़ाार पूंं�जीीकरण केे अनुुसार शीर्षष 2000 सूूचीीबद्ध संंस्थााओंं केे स्वतंंत्र नि�देेशक , एक वि�त्तीीय वर्षष मेंंं कम सेे कम दो बैैठकेंं आयोोजि�त करनाा अनि�वाार्यय हैै जि�नमेंंं गैैर-स्वतंंत्र नि�देेशक और प्रबंंंधन केे सदस्य उपस्थि�त नहींं होंंगेे; और सभी स्वतंंत्र नि�देेशक ऐसी बैैठकोंं मेंंं उपस्थि�त रहनेे का प्रयायाास करेंंगेे।\nवर्षष 2025-26 केे दौरान स्वतंंत्र नि�देेशकोंं की बैैठकेंं 18.12.2025 और 17.03.2026 को आयोजि त की गईं।\nF\n10) The extent of implementation of Discretionary Requirements of Regulation 27(1) of SEBI (LODR) Regulations, 2015 is as under:\nSl. No. Discretionary Requirements Status of Implementation\nThe Board: A Non-Executive Chairman may be entitled to maintain a Chairman’s Office at the listed entity’s expense and also allowed reimbursement of expenses incurred in performance of his duties.\nA\nComplied with\nThe Bank has sent Annual Financial Results along with the summary of significant developments during the year, to all the Shareholders. The Quarterly / Half Yearly / Annual Financial Results are updated on the website of the bank.\nB Shareholder Rights\nC Modified opinion(s) in audit report","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c864","section":"Corporate Governance","tag":"governance","page":344,"text":"C Modified opinion(s) in audit report\nThe Audit Report for the year 2025-26 is submitted with UNMODIFIED OPINION. There is no qualification in Auditors Report of the Bank.\nThe Government of India has nominated / appointed a separate person to the post of Chairperson and MD&CEO. The non-executive Chairman, Mr. Vijay Srirangan has been appointed on the Board of the Bank w.e.f. 07.11.2022 and ceased to be Chairman of the Bank w.e.f. 06.11.2025. The Chairperson is not related to the Managing Director or the Chief Executive Officer as per the definition of the term “relative” defined under the Companies Act, 2013.\nD Separa