EBI [LISTING OBLIGATIONS AND DISCLOSURE REQUIREMENTS\n(AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS, 2018 - SCHEDULE V(C)(10)(I)]","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c881","section":"Corporate Governance","tag":"governance","page":351,"text":"(AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS, 2018 - SCHEDULE V(C)(10)(I)]\nI, Swayambhu Viswanathan, Practising Company Secretary have examined the relevant registers, records, forms, returns and disclosures received from the Directors of Canara Bank having PAN AAACC6106G and having Registered Office at 112, J C Road, Town Hall, Bengaluru, Karnataka - 560002 (hereinafter referred to as “the Bank”), produced before me by the Bank for the purpose of issuing this certificate, in accordance with Regulation 34(3) read with Schedule V Para-C Sub clause 10(i) of the Securities Exchange Board of India (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015.\nIn my opinion and to the best of my information and according to the verifications [including Directors Identification Number (DIN)] as considered necessary and explanations furnished to me by the Bank & its officers, I hereby certify that none of the Directors on the Board of the Bank as stated below for the Financial Year ending on March 31, 2026 have been debarred or disqualified from being appointed or continuing as Directors of Bank by the Securities and Exchange Board of India, Ministry of Corporate Affairs, or any such other statutory authority\nSl. No. Name Designation DIN Date of Appointment\n.\n1 Shri Hardeep Singh Ahluwalia Managing Director & CEO (I/C) & Executive Director 09690464 February 07, 2023","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c882","section":"Corporate Governance","tag":"governance","page":351,"text":"1 Shri Hardeep Singh Ahluwalia Managing Director & CEO (I/C) & Executive Director 09690464 February 07, 2023\n2 Shri Bhavendra Kumar Executive Director 10401479 October 09, 2023 3 Shri Santanu Kumar Majumdar Executive Director 08223415 March 24, 2025 4 Shri Sunil Kumar Chugh Executive Director 08309168 November 24, 2025\n5 Shri Parshant Kumar Goyal Non-Executive - Nominee Director representing Government of India 08652921 October 25, 2023\n6 Shri Rohit P. Das Non-Executive - Nominee Director representing Reserve Bank of India Not available August 05, 2024\n7 Ms. Nalini Padmanabhan Non-Executive - Independent Director 01565909 April 11, 2025\n8 Ms. Abha Singh Yaduvanshi Non-Executive - Shareholder Director - Independent Director 09608526 July 27, 2022 (Re-appointed w.e.f.\nJuly 27, 2025)\n9 Shri Gunjeet Singh Pannu Non-Executive - Shareholder Director - Independent Director 10854996 July 27, 2025\n10 Shri Balakrishna Raghavendra Rao\nNon-Executive - Shareholder Director - Independent Director 08508501 September 13, 2025","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c883","section":"Corporate Governance","tag":"governance","page":351,"text":"Non-Executive - Shareholder Director - Independent Director 08508501 September 13, 2025\nEnsuring the eligibility for the appointment / continuity of every Director on the Board is the responsibility of the Management of the Bank. Our responsibility is to express an opinion on these based on our verification. This certificate is neither an assurance as to the future viability of the Bank nor of the efficiency or effectiveness with which the Management has conducted the affairs of the Bank.\nFor Swayambhu Viswanathan\nPractising Company Secretary\nSwayambhu Viswanathan FCS No.: 12190 | CP No.: 5284\nDate : April 30, 2026 Place : Bengaluru\nICSI PRN: 1857/2022 ICSI UDIN: F012190H000239285\nAppendix B\nपरि�शि�ष्ट बी\nPRACTISING COMPANY SECRETARY CERTIFICATE ON COMPLIANCE WITH CORPORATE GOVERNANCE REQUIREMENTS UNDER SEBI (LISTING OBLIGATIONS AND DISCLOSURE REQUIREMENTS) REGULATIONS, 2015, AS AMENDED.\nसेेबी (सूूचीीबद्धताा बाध्यताएंं एवंं प्रकटीीकरण अपेेक्षाएंं) अधिि+नि�यम, 2015, यथाा संंशोधिि+त केे तहत कॉॉर्पोोरेेट अभि1शाासन अपेेक्षाओंं केे अनुुपाालन पर अभ्याासरत कंंपनीी सचि�व प्रमाणपत्र\nTo, The Members of Canara Bank\nसेेवा मेंं,\nकेेनरा बैंंक केे सदस्य","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c884","section":"Corporate Governance","tag":"governance","page":352,"text":"केेनरा बैंंक केे सदस्य\nI have examined the compliance of conditions of Corporate Governance by Canara Bank (“the Bank”) for the year ended on March 31, 2026, as stipulated in Regulations 17 to 27 and clauses (b) to (i) [and (t)] of Regulation 46 (2) and paragraphs C, D and E of Schedule V of the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015 (“Listing Regulations”), as applicable during the year.\nमैंंनेे 31 माार्चच, 2026 को समााप्त वर्षष केे लि6ए, सेेबी (सूूचीबद्धता\nबाध्यताएंं एवंं प्रकटीीकरण अपेेक्षाएंं) अधि�नि�यम, 2015 (“सूूचीबद्धता\nअधि�नि�यम”) केे विि9नि�यम 17 सेे 27 और विि9नि�यम 46 (2) केे खंंड (बी) सेे\n(आई) [और (टी)] और अनुुसूूची वी केे पैैराग्राफ सी, डी और ई मेंं नि�र्धाधाारि�त\nव्यवस्थाा केे अंंतर्गत केेनरा बैंंंक (“बैंंंक”) द्वाारा कॉॉर्पोोरेेट अभि1शाासन की\nशर्तोंं केे अनुुपाालन की जांंच की हैै।\nकॉॉर्पोोरेेट अभि1शाासन की शर्तोंं का अनुुपाालन प्रबंंधन की\nThe compliance of conditions of Corporate Governance is the responsibility of the Management. Our examination was limited to procedures and implementation thereof, adopted by the Bank for ensuring the compliance of the conditions of the Corporate Governance. It is neither an audit nor an expression of opinion on the financial statements of the Bank.\nजि म्मेेदाारी हैै। हमाारी जांंच बैंंंक द्वाारा कॉॉर्पोोरेेट अभि1शाासन की शर्तोंं केे","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c885","section":"Corporate Governance","tag":"governance","page":352,"text":"जि म्मेेदाारी हैै। हमाारी जांंच बैंंंक द्वाारा कॉॉर्पोोरेेट अभि1शाासन की शर्तोंं केे\nअनुुपाालन को सुुनि�श्चििȋत करनेे केे लि6ए अपनााई गई प्रक्रि�याओंं और\nउनकेे कार्याान्वयन तक सीमि�त थी। यह न तो लेेखापरीीक्षा हैै और न ही\nबैंंंक केे विि9त्तीय विि9वरणोंं पर कोई राय हैै।\nसंंबंंधि�त अभि1लेेखोंं की हमाारी जांंच केे आधाार पर और हमाारी राय\nBased on our examination of the relevant records and in our opinion and to the best of our information and according to the explanations given to us, I certify that the Bank has in all material aspects, complied with the conditions of Corporate Governance as stipulated in above mentioned SEBI Regulations to the extent these do not contradict the Banking Regulation Act, 1949 and Banking Companies (Acquisition and Transfer of Undertakings) Act, 1970 for the year ended March 31, 2026.\nतथाा सर्वोोत्तम जानकारी एवंं प्रस्तुुत स्पष्टीीकरणोंं केे आधाार पर,\nमैंं प्रमााणि�त करताा / करतीी हूंं� कि� बैंंंक नेे उपर्युु�क्त सेेबी विि9नि�यमोंं मेंं\nनि�र्धाधाारि�त कॉॉर्पोोरेेट अभि1शाासन की शर्तोंं केे सभी महत्वपूूर्णण पहलुु ओंं\nका अनुुपाालन कि�याा हैै, बशर्तेे कि� 31 माार्चच, 2026 को समााप्त हुुए\nवर्षष केे लि6ए लागूू बैंंंकिं�ंग विि9नि�यमन अधि�नि�यम, 1949 और बैंंंकिं�ंग\nकंंपनि�यांं (अधि�ग्रहण और उपक्रमोंं का अंंतरण) अधि�नि�यम, 1970 केे\nविि9परीीत न होंं।\nमैंं साथ ही साथ यह भी कहनाा चाहताा हूंं� कि� इस प्रकार का","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c886","section":"Corporate Governance","tag":"governance","page":352,"text":"मैंं साथ ही साथ यह भी कहनाा चाहताा हूंं� कि� इस प्रकार का\nअनुुपाालन न तो बैंंंक की भविि9ष्य की व्यवहाार्ययता की गारंंटी देेता हैै\nI further state that such compliance is neither an assurance as to the future viability of the Bank nor the efficiency or effectiveness with which the Management has conducted the affairs of the Bank.\nऔर न ही उसकी दक्षता या प्रभावशीीलताा की गारंंटी देेता हैै, जि सकेे साथ\nप्रबंंधन नेे बैंंंक केे माामलोंं का संंचालन कि�याा हैै।\nयह प्रमााणपत्र केेवल बैंंंक केे सदस्योंं को ही दि�याा गया हैै ताकि� बैंंंक\nThis certificate is addressed and provided to the members of the Bank solely for the purpose to enable the Bank to comply with the Listing Regulations, and\nसूूचीबद्धता विि9नि�यमोंं का अनुुपाालन कर सकेे। इसका उपयोोग कि�सीी\nअन्य व्यक्तििŘ द्वाारा या कि�सीी अन्य उद्देेश्य केे लि6ए नहींं कि�याा जाना\nit should not be used by any other person or for any other purpose. Accordingly, I do not accept or assume any liability or duty of care for any other purpose or to any other person to whom this certificate is shown or into whose hands it may come without our prior consent in writing.\nचाहि�ए। तदनुुसार, इस प्रमााणपत्र केे कि�सीी अन्य उद्देेश्य हेेतुु उपयोोग या\nकि�सीी अन्य व्यक्तििŘ को प्रदर्शि�ित कि�ए जानेे अथवाा हमाारी\nपूूर्वव लि6खि\u001aत सहमति� केे बि�नाा कि�सीी अन्य व्यक्तििŘ केे हाथोंं मेंं पहुँँ�चनेे की","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c887","section":"Corporate Governance","tag":"governance","page":353,"text":"पूूर्वव लि6खि\u001aत सहमति� केे बि�नाा कि�सीी अन्य व्यक्तििŘ केे हाथोंं मेंं पहुँँ�चनेे की\nस्थिȤति� मेंं, मैंं कि�सीी भी प्रकार की ज़ि�म्मेेदाारी अथवाा उत्तरदाायि�त्व स्वीकार\nनहींं करताा / करतीी हूँँ�।\nFor Swayambhu Viswanathan\nकृृतेे स्वयंंभूू वि�श्वनाथन,\nPractising Company Secretary\nअभ्याासरत कंंपनीी सचि�व एफआरएन: P2023KR098600\nFRN: P2023KR098600\nस्वयंंभूू वि�श्वनाथन एफसीीएस नंं.: 12190 | सीपीी नंं.: 5284 आईसीएसआई पीीआरएन: 1857/2022\nSwayambhu Viswanathan FCS No.: 12190 | CP No.: 5284\nICSI PRN: 1857/2022\nआईसीएसआई यूूडीआईएन: F012190H000308453 स्थाान : बेंंंगलूूरु दि�नांंक : 11 मई, 2026\nICSI UDIN: F012190H00030845