ll the information and explanations which, to the best of our knowledge and belief, were necessary for the purposes of our audit and have found them to be satisfactory;\na) हमनेे वह समस्त जा ानका ारी और स्पष्टीीकरण मांं गेे और प्रााप्त कि�ए हैंं, जो हमारी सर्वोोत्तम जानका ारी और वि9श्वास केे अनुुसाार, हमारी लेेखाापरीक्षाा केे प्रयोजनोंं केे लि�ए आवश्यक थेे और उन्हेंं संंतोषजनक पााया गयाा हैै;\nb) The transactions of the Bank, which have come to our notice, have been within the powers of the Bank;\nb) बैंंक केे लेेन-देेन, जो हमारी जानका ारी मेंं आए हैंं, बैंंक की ी शक्ति�योंं केे अंंतर्गगत रहेे हैंं;\nc) The returns received from the offices and branches of the Bank have been found adequate for the purposes of our audit; and\nc) बैंंक केे कार्याालयोंं और शााखााओंं सेे प्राप्त वि9वरणि�यांं हमारी लेेखाापरीक्षाा केे उद्देेश्योंं केे लि�ए पर्यााप्त पाया गयाा हैै; और\nd) The consolidated profit and loss account shows a true balance of profit for the year then ended.","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c1296","section":"Auditor's Report","tag":"auditor","page":542,"text":"d) The consolidated profit and loss account shows a true balance of profit for the year then ended.\nd) समेेकि�त लाभ व हानि� बहीी उस अवधि� केे अंंत मेंं हुुए लाभ का वास्तवि9क बहीी खााता दर्शााता हैै।\n13. We further report that\n13. हम आगेे रि�पोोर्टट करतेे हैंं कि�\na) In our opinion, proper books of account as required by law have been kept by the Group so far as it appears from our examination of those books;\na) हमारी रााय मेंं, वि9धि�क द्वााराा अपेेक्षि�त बहीी खााता का उचि�त रखर खााव समूूह द्वााराा कि�याा गयाा हैै, जैैसाा कि� उन बहीी खााता की हमारी जाँँच सेे प्रतीत होता हैै|\nb) The Consolidated Balance Sheet, Consolidated Profit and Loss Account and Consolidated Cash flow statement dealt with by this report are in agreement with the books of account and with the returns received fro