e":598,"text":"कि�याा गया हैै।\n11. The consolidated financial results are prepared in accordance with Accounting Standard 21 on “Accounting for Consolidated Financial Statements”, Accounting Standard 23 on “Accounting for Investment in Associates in Consolidated Financial Statements”, using equity method for associates and proportionate method for subsidiaries and Accounting Standard 27 on “Financial Reporting of Interests in Joint Ventures” issued by the Institute of Chartered Accountants of India and guidelines issued by the RBI.\n11. समेेकि�त वि9त्तीीय परि�णााम “समेेकि�त वि9त्तीीय वि9वरणोंं केे लि�ए\nलेेखांंकन” पर लेेखांंकन मानक 21, “सहयोगिि\u001bयोंं मेंं नि�वेेश केे लि�ए\nलेेखांंकन” पर लेेखांंकन मानक 23, सहयोगी संंस्थााओंं केे लि�ए\nइक्विšटी पद्धति� और अनुुषंंगी संंस्थााओंं केे लि�ए आनुुपाति�क पद्धति�\nका उपयोग करतेे हुुए, तथा भाारतीय सनदी लेेखाकार संंस्थाान द्वाारा\nजारी “संंयुुक्त उद्यमोंं मेंं हि�त कीी वि9त्तीीय रि�पोर्टिं#ं�ग” पर लेेखांंकन\nमानक 27 और भाारतीय रि�जर्वव बैंंक द्वाारा जारी दि�शाानि�र्देेशोंं केे\nअनुुसार तैैयार कि�ए गए हैंं।\n12. Accounting Standard 28 - Impairment of Assets:\n12. लेेखांंकन माानक 28- आस्ति�योंं की क्षति�:","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c1440","section":"Cash Flow Statement","tag":"cashflow","page":599,"text":"12. लेेखांंकन माानक 28- आस्ति�योंं की क्षति�:\nAssets are reviewed for impairment at the end of the year whenever events or changes in circumstances warrant that the carrying amount of an asset may not be recoverable. Recoverability of an asset to be held and used is measured by a comparison of the carrying amount of an asset to the future net discounted cash flows expected to be generated by the asset. If such an asset is considered to be impaired, the impairment to be recognized is measured by the amount by which the carrying amount exceeds the recoverable amount of the asset. However, in the opinion of the Bank’s Management, there is no indication of material impairment to the assets during the year.","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c1441","section":"Cash Flow Statement","tag":"cashflow","page":599,"text":"वर्ष केे अंंत मेंं, जब भी ऐसी घटनााएँँ या परि�स्थि�ति�योंं मेंं परि�वर्ततन होतेे हैंं, जि�ससेे यह पता चचलता हैै कि� कि�सीी आस्ति� कीी वहन राशि� वसूूली योग्य नहींं हो सकतीी, तो आस्ति�योंं कीी क्षति� कीी समीक्षाा कीी जाती हैै। धारि�त व प्रयुुक्त कीी जानेे वाली आस्ति� कीी वसूूली योग्यता को आस्ति� केे वहन राशि� सेे आस्ति� द्वाारा उत्पन्न होनेे हेेतुु संंभाावि9त फ्यूूचचर नि�वल भुुनायेे गयेे नकद प्रवााह कीी तुुलना कर मापा जाना हैै। यदि� ऐसी आस्ति� को हानि� माना जाए तो उस हानि� को आस्ति� केे वसूूली-योग्य राशि� सेे अधि�क हुुए आस्ति� केे वहन राशि� द्वाारा मान्यता दी जानी हैै और तदनुुसार मापा जाना हैै। यद्यपि�, बैंंक केे प्रबंंंधन कीी राय मेंं जि�स वर्ष मेंं लेेखांंकन मानक 28 “आस्ति�योंं कीी हानि�” लागूू हैै, उस वर्ष केे दौरान आस्ति�योंं केे भौति�क हानि� का कोई संंकेेत नहींं हैै।\n13. दि�नांंक 31.03.2026 को समाप्त हुुए वर्ष केे दौरान, बैंंक नेे कुुल\n13. During the year ended 31.03.2026, Bank had issued Basel III Compliant Tier I Bonds aggregating to `3,500 Crores and redeemed Basel III Compliant Tier I Bonds aggregating to `2,936.10 Crores. Further, during the year ended 31.03.2026, Bank issued Basel III Compliant Tier II Bonds aggregating to `5,000 Crores and redeemed Basel III Compliant Tier II Bonds aggregating to `4,150 Crores.","doc_type":"annual_report","document":"Annual report · year ended 31 March 2026","document_date":"2026-03-31","document_rank":0,"page_kind":"pdf"},{"id":"c1442","section":"Cash Flow Statement","tag":"cashflow","page":599,"text":"`3,500 करोोड़ केे बेेसल III-अनुुरूप टि#यर I बॉन्ड जारी कि�ए और कुुल `2,936.10 करोोड़ केे बेेसल III-अनुुरूप टि#यर I बॉन्ड का मोचचन कि�याा। इसकेे अति�रि�क्त, दि�नांंक 31.03.2026 को समाप्त हुुए